Docker
Build and start all services in the background: docker-compose up --build

Stop everything: docker-compose down

View logs for Celery: docker-compose logs -f celery

Run migrations inside Docker: docker-compose exec backend python manage.py migrate

Create a superuser: docker-compose exec backend python manage.py createsuperuser

Backend

pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver 8000

Frontend
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev